    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Yatoon Booking provides a clean multi-step booking flow, customer self-service, waitlist recovery, Text Us fallback, cancellation/no-show policy display, and admin customer history.</p>\n<h3>Shortcodes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[yatoon_booking] &#8211; booking form.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_customer_portal] &#8211; customer appointment portal.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_manage_booking] &#8211; secure manage booking page.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_service_menu] &#8211; public service menu.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>5.2.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added: Service editor can now mark services with the booking-page Popular badge.</li>\n<li>Added: Brand settings now control Popular, Recommended, Add-on, and option/add-on section labels.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>5.2.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Cleaned remaining visible mojibake in public booking view assets and documentation.</li>\n<li>Improved: No-availability messages now distinguish network issues, Square/Vagaro connection issues, staff unavailable, and service unavailable states.</li>\n<li>Added: Customer recovery actions for Try another date, Choose staff, Text us, and optional Join Waitlist.</li>\n<li>Added: Settings for time-source note, waitlist recovery, success next-step card, and success/recovery copy.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Mobile-friendly appointment booking for salons, spas, and service businesses.",
    "description": "<p>Yatoon Booking provides a clean multi-step booking flow, customer self-service, waitlist recovery, Text Us fallback, cancellation/no-show policy display, and admin customer history.</p>\n<h3>Shortcodes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[yatoon_booking] &#8211; booking form.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_customer_portal] &#8211; customer appointment portal.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_manage_booking] &#8211; secure manage booking page.</li>\n<li>[yatoon_service_menu] &#8211; public service menu.</li>\n</ul>\n",
